{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>Do you know the disposition of the cloud</b> [upon them] — as the Place [i.e., HaShem] has set the clouds upon the children of men." "<b>And the shining</b> — and He showed the light within the clouds. Or: <b>do you know the wondrous works of the cloud</b> [מפלשי עב] — like \"He weighs [פלס] the circle of your foot\" [Proverbs 5:5], as though they are weighed [שקולים] on a balance [פלס]."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {1 "The second interpretation reads מפלשי עב as a variant or revocalization of the word rendered in the first interpretation; Ibn Ezra appears to connect it to the root פלס in the sense of balancing/weighing."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:53.877112878Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}